                <head>Agreement between the United States and El Salvador for the one-year renewal
                    of the agreement of May 21, 1943, providing for the detail of an officer of the
                    United States Army to serve as director of the Military School and of the
                    Military Academy of El Salvador</head>
                <p>[Effected by exchange of notes signed at Washington March 4 and April 7, 1947;
                    notes not printed (816.223/3–447). For text of agreement of May 21, 1943, see
                    Department of State Executive Agreement Series No. 328, or 57 Stat. (pt. 2)
                    1000.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
